      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 77-year-old man was admitted to this hospital because of confusion and malaise after resection of a papillary urothelial cancer. He reported abdominal pain, facial and jaw pain, anorexia, lethargy, weakness, and night sweats; imaging revealed generalized lymphadenopathy."},
